'''Indigo Paints Limited''' is an Indian [[paint]] company that is headquartered in [[Pune]], [[Maharashtra]], and has five manufacturing facilities that are located at [[Jodhpur]], [[Kochi]] and [[Pudukkottai]].<ref>{{ cite news| date=20 January 2020 | title= Indigo Paints growth rate to beat industry for many years to come: Hemant Jalan | url= https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/expert-view/indigo-paints-growth-rate-to-beat-industry-rate-for-many-years-to-come-hemant-jalan/articleshow/80365662.cms |publisher=[[The Economic Times]]|accessdate=26 April 2021}}</ref><ref name="HBL">{{cite news|last=Law |first=Abhishek |date=24 June 2019 | title=Indigo Paints plans to raise up to ₹800 crore via IPO | url= https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/indigo-paints-plans-to-raise-up-to-800-crore-via-ipo/article28127354.eceml |publisher=[[Business Line]]|accessdate=13 April 2020}}</ref> The company is engaged in manufacturing, selling and distribution of decorative paints, [[Emulsion]], enamels, waterproofing & chemical constructions, wood coatings, [[Distemper (paint)|distemper]], [[Primer (paint)|primers]], [[putty|putties]] and cement paints.<ref>{{cite news | date= 17 March 2021 | title= Indigo Paints hits lowest level since listing, slips 29% from all-time high | url= https://www.business-standard.com/article/markets/indigo-paints-hits-lowest-level-since-listing-down-29-from-high-121031700380_1.html | publisher= [[Business Standard]] | accessdate= 7 April 2021 | archive-date= 22 March 2021 | archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20210322015906/https://www.business-standard.com/article/markets/indigo-paints-hits-lowest-level-since-listing-down-29-from-high-121031700380_1.html | url-status= live }}</ref>

==History==
In 2000, Hemant Jalan founded Indigo Paints to manufacture cement paint; by 2021 the company scaled up to become the fifth largest player in terms of revenue generation in the decorative paint industry.<ref>{{cite news|last=Srivastava |first=Samar |date=23 July 2018 | title= Indigo Paints: Adding colours with a new brush | url= https://www.forbesindia.com/article/hidden-gems-2018/indigo-paints-adding-colours-with-a-new-brush/50805/1 |work=[[Forbes]]|accessdate= 7 April 2021}}</ref><ref name="TOI">{{cite news|last=Sarkar |first=John |date=8 December 2019 | title= We are aiming for Rs 3,000 crore in five years: MD Indigo Paints | url= https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/we-are-aiming-for-rs-3000-crore-in-five-years-md-indigo-paints/articleshow/ |work=[[The Times Of India]]|accessdate= 7 April 2021}}</ref> In December 2019, Jalan stated that the company had established a distribution network across 27 states and seven union territories.<ref name="HBL" /><ref>{{cite news |last=Matkar |first=Sunil |date=20 January 2021 |title=Indigo Paints IPO worth Rs 1,170 crore opens today: Should you subscribe? |url=https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/ipo/indigo-paints-ipo-worth-rs-1170-crore-opens-today-should-you-subscribe-6366821.html |publisher=[[Moneycontrol.com]] |accessdate=7 April 2021 |archive-date=27 April 2021 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210427065348/https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/ipo/indigo-paints-ipo-worth-rs-1170-crore-opens-today-should-you-subscribe-6366821.html |url-status=live }}</ref><ref name="BQ">{{cite news|last=D'Souza |first=Sharleen |date=19 January 2021 | title= Indigo Paints IPO: Here's All You Need To Know | url= https://www.bloombergquint.com/ipos/indigo-paints-ipo-heres-all-you-need-to-know |publisher=Bloomberg|accessdate= 12 April 2021}}</ref> In 2018, [[Mahendra Singh Dhoni]] became the company’s brand ambassador.<ref>{{cite news |last=Laghate |first=Gaurav |date=15 June 2018 |title=Indigo Paints signs MS Dhoni as brand ambassador; plans Rs 240 crore ad spend over 3 years |url=https://m.economictimes.com/industry/services/advertising/indigo-paints-signs-ms-dhoni-as-brand-ambassador/amp_articleshow |publisher=[[The Economic Times]] |access-date=7 April 2021 |archive-date=10 October 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231010104118/https://m.economictimes.com/industry/services/advertising/indigo-paints-signs-ms-dhoni-as-brand-ambassador/amp_articleshow |url-status=live }}</ref> In 2014, [[Sequoia Capital]] first invested ₹55 crore in the firm and later in 2016,  an additional ₹95 crore in 2016.<ref name="HBL" /> In 2021, as a part of its [[initial public offering|IPO]], the firm raised ₹348 crore from 25 anchor investors including the [[Government of Singapore]], [[Fidelity]], [[Goldman Sachs]], [[Nomura Group|Nomura]], [[HSBC]], [[Pacific Horizon Investment Trust]], [[SBI Mutual Fund]], [[ICICI Prudential Mutual Fund]] and [[Axis Mutual Fund]].<ref>{{cite news|date=20 January 2021|title=Indigo Paints raises Rs 348 crore from 25 anchor investors ahead of IPO|url=https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/ipo/indigo-paints-raises-rs-348-crore-from-25-anchor-investors-ahead-of-ipo-6367871.html|publisher=[[Moneycontrol.com]]|accessdate=13 April 2021|archive-date=16 April 2021|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210416200325/https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/ipo/indigo-paints-raises-rs-348-crore-from-25-anchor-investors-ahead-of-ipo-6367871.html|url-status=live}}</ref> In 2022, company onboarded [[Mohanlal]] as a brand ambassador for promoting its products in the state of [[Kerala]]. In 2023, Indigo Paints forayed into the waterproofing and construction chemicals segments, with the acquisition of 51 percent stake<ref>{{Cite web |date=2023-04-05 |title=Indigo Paints gains on waterproofing business foray; to compete with Pidilite, Asian Paints |url=https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/stocks/indigo-paints-shares-gain-on-foray-into-waterproofing-construction-chemicals-10363821.html |access-date=2023-10-10 |website=Moneycontrol |language=en |archive-date=5 April 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230405212913/https://www.moneycontrol.com/news/business/stocks/indigo-paints-shares-gain-on-foray-into-waterproofing-construction-chemicals-10363821.html |url-status=live }}</ref> in Apple Chemie India Private Ltd (ACIPL).

==Initial public offering==
On 20 January 2021, Indigo Paints launched its [[initial public offering]] (IPO) of about 1170 crores; the price band was fixed at ₹1,488-1,490 apiece.<ref name="BQ" /> The issue was oversubscribed by 117 times.<ref name="BQ" /><ref>{{cite news|date=19 January 2021 | title= Indigo Paints IPO subscribed over 50 times so far on final day | url= https://www.livemint.com/market/ipo/indigo-paints-ipo-subscription-allotment-listing-gains-and-date-details-11611122719965.html |publisher=[[Mint (newspaper)|Mint]] |accessdate= 12 April 2021}}</ref> On February, 2 2021, Indigo Paints Limited made its debut on the [[National Stock Exchange of India Limited|NSE]] and the [[Bombay Stock Exchange|BSE]] at a price of ₹2,607.5 per share, a 75 percent premium over its issue price of ₹1,490.<ref>{{cite news |last=D'Souza |first=Sharleen |date=2 February 2021 |title=Indigo Paints Shares Double Over IPO Price On Market Debut |url=https://www.bloombergquint.com/markets/indigo-paints-lists-at-75-premium-on-stock-market-debut |publisher=Bloomberg |accessdate=12 April 2021 |archive-date=27 April 2021 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20210427065343/https://www.bloombergquint.com/markets/indigo-paints-lists-at-75-premium-on-stock-market-debut |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite news | date= 2 February 2021 | title= Indigo Paints shares listing on BSE, NSE today: Grey market premium strong, bumper debut likely | url= https://www.indiatvnews.com/business/markets-indigo-paints-ipo-share-listing-price-news-bse-nse-update-grey-market-premium-682052 | publisher= [[India TV]] | accessdate= 7 April 2021 | archive-date= 21 April 2021 | archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20210421210308/https://www.indiatvnews.com/business/markets-indigo-paints-ipo-share-listing-price-news-bse-nse-update-grey-market-premium-682052 | url-status= live }}</ref><ref name="FE">{{cite news | last= Bhargava | first= Kshitij | date= 2 February 2021 | title= Indigo Paints shares hit 20% upper circuit after bumper debut; total listing day gains touch 110% | url= https://www.financialexpress.com/market/indigo-paints-ipo-listing-price-shares-debut-on-sensex-nifty/2185536/ | publisher= [[The Financial Express (India)|Financial Express]] | accessdate= 7 April 2021 | archive-date= 27 April 2021 | archive-url= https://web.archive.org/web/20210427065240/https://www.financialexpress.com/market/indigo-paints-ipo-listing-price-shares-debut-on-sensex-nifty/2185536/ | url-status= live }}</ref> On the listing day, the stock price more than doubled to hit the upper circuit at ₹3,129 per share.<ref name="keypeople" />

